The one thing that I think
it's probably worth stating is

00:18:53.760 --> 00:18:57.600
this thing just happen that is Chat GPT

00:18:58.920 --> 00:19:01.200
and GPT family of models.

00:19:01.200 --> 00:19:02.760
This is something that
we've been partnered

00:19:02.760 --> 00:19:05.040
with OpenAI deeply now for multiple years,

00:19:05.040 --> 00:19:07.860
and we built in Azure,

00:19:07.860 --> 00:19:12.240
our public cloud infrastructure,
an AI supercomputer,

00:19:13.320 --> 00:19:16.020
which, by the way, as
a systems architecture

00:19:16.020 --> 00:19:17.460
has been a massive breakthrough

00:19:17.460 --> 00:19:19.500
because the way these workloads

00:19:19.500 --> 00:19:23.160
or the way you train large
models is very different

00:19:23.160 --> 00:19:25.740
