being at home and maximizing productivity,

00:21:11.580 --> 00:21:15.300
but still having a healthy
culture and connectivity,

00:21:15.300 --> 00:21:16.620
what's right for you, do you think?

00:21:16.620 --> 00:21:18.300
- Yeah, I mean, look, there is,

00:21:18.840 --> 00:21:21.540
there are three things at
least we observe in the data

00:21:21.540 --> 00:21:25.260
that we are at in aggregate that we use

00:21:25.260 --> 00:21:27.660
to even inform our own set of policies.

00:21:28.200 --> 00:21:31.380
The first is what you reference,
which is there is this,

00:21:31.380 --> 00:21:35.400
what I would call paranoia
around productivity, right?

00:21:35.400 --> 00:21:37.380
Every boss thinks that somehow

00:21:37.380 --> 00:21:38.820
they're not being as productive,

00:21:38.820 --> 00:21:42.060
every person working thinks
