00:21:48.060 --> 00:21:51.840
And I think the only way out
of that is to have data, right?

00:21:51.840 --> 00:21:54.660
Not dogma, which is, you know,

00:21:54.660 --> 00:21:57.300
ultimately we are all gonna be
responsible for the outcomes

00:21:57.300 --> 00:21:59.460
and if we are managing to the outcomes,

00:22:00.060 --> 00:22:00.960
then we'll be better off.

00:22:00.960 --> 00:22:02.400
So that's sort of one side of it.

00:22:02.400 --> 00:22:04.920
The second thing I
