and make that event exciting.

00:22:29.160 --> 00:22:29.940
I think I would say,

00:22:29.940 --> 00:22:32.100
I say like the new management
technique is all of us

00:22:32.100 --> 00:22:34.980
are event managers, and I think that's,

00:22:34.980 --> 00:22:38.280
so we'll have to learn many
new soft tech, you know,

00:22:38.280 --> 00:22:40.680
soft management techniques in
order to get people to connect

00:22:40.680 --> 00:22:42.000
with people because it's important.

00:22:42.000 --> 00:22:43.018
- So go ahead finish it.

00:22:43.018 --> 00:22:44.760
- And then the last thing I'd say

00:22:44.760 --> 00:22:47.280
is even recruitment, right,
which is one of the things that,

