So I think being a little more deliberate

00:23:48.660 --> 00:23:52.080
about things that you do while
exercising your flexibility,

00:23:53.040 --> 00:23:54.300
I think is what's gonna have to happen.

00:23:54.300 --> 00:23:56.280
- And one other point on
this for you as a boss,

00:23:56.280 --> 00:23:57.960
I think one of the complaints you hear,

